</p><p id="Par34">The preoperative and postoperative mean (median difference) global and dimensional QoR-40 scores are presented in Table&#x000a0;<xref rid="Tab4" ref-type="table">4</xref>. The median (minimum-maximum) postoperative global QoR-40 scores were significantly better in group M-TAPA than in the group control (189 [156&#x02013;198] vs. 179.5 [146&#x02013;191] (P&#x02009;&#x0003c;&#x02009;0.001) (Table&#x000a0;<xref rid="Tab4" ref-type="table">4</xref>).</p><p id="Par35">
